** sch_path: /home/claude/tt-eeg-afe/design/xschem/eeg_afe_top.sch
.subckt eeg_afe_top ua0 ua1 rst vdd vss
*.iopin ua0
*.iopin ua1
*.ipin rst
*.iopin vdd
*.iopin vss
XBIAS vdd vss vbp vref bias
XAFE ua0 ua1 vdd vss vbp vref rst afe
.ends


